{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/wishlist_now.png?t=1732481237\" /><br><br>Nazizombies Slayer is a hardcore top-down pixel shooter. Complete guild tasks, buy equipment, kill your enemies, solve level challenges, follow the development of the plot and enjoy the gameplay.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/killing_wide2.gif?t=1732481237\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/Core_mechanics.png?t=1732481237\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Stealth. Move slowly behind enemies' backs to avoid making noise and being seen.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/stealth.gif?t=1732481237\" /><br></li><li> Use mines and grenades to freeze enemies, poison them, or deal damage. Combine them to get new effects and new abilities.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/interact.gif?t=1732481237\" /><br></li><li>Change and upgrade your costumes to increase your stats.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/suits.gif?t=1732481237\" /><br></li><li> Increase your capital. Trade items found in levels at the bar.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/market.gif?t=1732481237\" /><br></li><li> Find secrets in the levels and solve simple puzzles.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/Story.png?t=1732481237\" /><br>The state of Zeichland declares war and starts fighting against the whole world. This is a terrible and uncomplicated situation for all mankind, but not for mercenaries, who see it only as an opportunity to earn money. The story is told on behalf of a mysterious mercenary from Big Earth, who arrived in Lower Zeich and settled in the newly opened branch of the Lanor Guild. You will have to fulfill the guild's tasks and follow the consequences of what is happening.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/Licia.gif?t=1732481237\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2536870?t=1732481237","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1732481237","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1732481237","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1732481237","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Nazizombie Slayer features intense cartoon violence, blood gore and strong language."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3022460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/wishlist_now.png?t=1732481237\" /><br><br>Nazizombies Slayer is a hardcore top-down pixel shooter. Complete guild tasks, buy equipment, kill your enemies, solve level challenges, follow the development of the plot and enjoy the gameplay.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2536870/extras/killing_wide2.gif?t=1732481237\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/